en	Please check the ⟦T1⟧ on well 12.	请检查井12上的⟦T1⟧。
en	The ⟦T1⟧ and the ⟦T2⟧ were replaced yesterday.	昨天更换了⟦T1⟧和⟦T2⟧。
en	⟦T2⟧ data shows the ⟦T3⟧ is too high.	⟦T2⟧数据显示⟦T3⟧太高。
en	We need to tune the ⟦T1⟧ before deployment.	我们需要在部署前调整⟦T1⟧。
en	Send me the ⟦T3⟧ report by Friday.	周五之前把⟦T3⟧报告发给我。
en	⟦T1⟧ failed after the firmware update.	⟦T1⟧在固件更新后失败。
